{
  "description": "Two dependent tool calls in one turn: GetBaseNumber(seed=23) -> 1023, then AddNumbers(a=1023, b=19) -> 1042. Asserts the conversation output keeps the FULL multi-round trace (both assistant tool_call messages and both tool responses), not just the final answer.",
